tatus":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q11","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"b1c534c68981a1d4abef83d10baa81aef937de5d26656314766324c07719fd17","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11.“福建舰”是我国第一艘采用电磁弹射装置的航空母舰.如图是某实验小组做的弹射模拟装置,首先将单刀双掷开关打到a,用电动势为E的电源给电容为C的电容器充电.电容器充满电后开关打到b,驱动线圈通电产生磁场,同时发射线圈从绝缘且内壁光滑的发射管道内弹射出去. 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9bf1c22a753fc03d14f4f45099a958678f6d873c0d44d784622d5e659866abb5.png","width":491,"height":193,"width_mm":57.54,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第11题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 发射线圈中感应电流产生的磁场水平向右"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 开关打到 b 的瞬间, 发射线圈中的感应电动势最大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 开关打到 b 的瞬间, 驱动线圈的自感电动势最小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 开关打到 b 的瞬间, 发射线圈的安培力最大"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q12","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"单选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"84212eff1795730683933cab6ab03de128064d004228818d3288a332d482284b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 如图是氢原子的能级, 一群处于基态的氢原子吸收某频率光子能量后跃迁到了 n=4 能级, 很快这些氢原子开始向下跃迁, 放出不同频率的光, 这些光照射在逸出功为 3.34 eV 的锌板上. 已知可见光的光子能量范围为 1.62 eV 到 3.11 eV. 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a5fd143cd1cc6f0d44718e6460118c28a68d827b08b0cf5353c631c784dc1d9c.png","width":253,"height":263,"width_mm":29.61,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第12题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 吸收的光子能量可能大于 12.75 eV"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 跃迁时, 最多能发出 6 种不同频率的可见光"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 存在可以使锌板发生光电效应的可见光"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 锌板表面逸出光电子的最大初动能为 9.41 eV"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q13","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"单选题","topics":["近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"cef89b6c44fe74b0f8096b695b9fbf62734783f997a0d6c4d089698aa4ab7078","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图甲所示是弗兰克—赫兹实验,该实验为能量量子化假设提供了直接证据. 实验前,装置内仅充满汞原子. 实验中,灯丝发射出初速度可忽略的电子,先经过阴极 K 与栅极 G 之间的电场加速,再经过栅极 G 与集电极 A 之间的反向电场减速. 电子在整个运动过程中会和汞原子碰撞. 实验中记录了栅极 G 到阴极 K 的电压大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{GK}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，以及通过集电极 A 的电流 I，电流越大说明单位时间到达集电极 A 的电子越多。实验结果如图乙所示，电流 I 的极大值呈周期性出现，峰值的水平间距为 4.9 V，从中得出汞原子能量具有量子化的结论。由于电子质量远远小于汞原子质量，通过弹性碰撞转移给汞原子的动能可以忽略不计。结合以上内容判断下列说法错误的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/335d8f87e333e2a98bb5354d2cfe46b08e2c9ed937244db4b459f38e30d56961.png","width":359,"height":266,"width_mm":42,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第13题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ae5064d4e6b4deb88a28f56bf1389466cc0a889a637136c349ef0980ae4e0160.png","width":328,"height":314,"width_mm":38.538,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第13题图乙\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{GK} < 4.9\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，电子与汞原子碰撞不会使处于基态的汞原子激发"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B.峰值的水平间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"4.9\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，说明汞原子第一激发态与基态的能量差为 "},{"type":"math","value":"4.9\\mathrm{eV}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C.只有当电子的动能等于 "},{"type":"math","value":"4.9\\mathrm{eV}"},{"type":"text","value":" 或其整数倍才能使汞原子从基态跃迁到第一激发态"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{GK} = 10\\mathrm{V}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，有大量电子两次与汞原子碰撞，使汞原子从基态跃迁到第一激发态"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"02eb43bece6143a146595751195759fe08f0096301b0119d68ac55b51a865af2","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 如图所示, 一束复色光从等边三棱镜 ABC 的 AB 边中点 D 射入, 入射光线与水平面夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 最后色散成两种单色光从 AC 边射出, 打在右侧白纸上, 上方为 a 光, 下方为 b 光. 其中 a 光的出射位置为 AC 边中点 E. 下列说法中正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/954c5db0b68c66a52c59d9c28371dfbc75cd1fd616fad459cec40b9c7661d292.png","width":366,"height":259,"width_mm":42.929,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 经过相同的狭缝, a 光比 b 光更容易发生明显的衍射现象"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. a 光在真空中的传播速度大于 b 光"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若 a、b 光分别通过相同的双缝装置, a 光的条纹间距大于 b 光的条纹间距"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 该复色光若垂直 AB 方向从 A、D 两点间入射, 则 a 光不能从 AC 边射出"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"ACD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"多选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3f9bf093ad311384fb68e9a743d3f7019ef0073b9e7d2ee8ea18bcbc8d99a97a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. 图甲是一列机械波在 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0.1 \\mathrm{~s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时刻的波形图, 图乙是平衡位置在 "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 4 \\mathrm{~m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处质点的振动图像, 则下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/938d41277c1859e949237f5a66c24de8fd39433b194f898c04cfd53875e1b82e.png","width":345,"height":178,"width_mm":40.53,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3bea313db16d15888001411c84e732c32fee06d679818a178812b776846d7a85.png","width":326,"height":178,"width_mm":38.22,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图乙\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A.该列波向右传播，传播速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"20\\mathrm{m / s}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质点经过 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.4\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的时间将沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴传播 "},{"type":"math","value":"8\\mathrm{m}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C.在 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0.15\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时， "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质点具有向下的最大加速度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0~\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 到 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0.125\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间内， "},{"type":"math","value":"x = 4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的质点经过的路程为 "},{"type":"math","value":"(8 + 2\\sqrt{2})"},{"type":"text","value":" cm"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学","热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"65e2b9b6518fae246cec3d02abb1884e5be95c0c6f69b2596d467570c1c7be6e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. I. 实验小组分别用如图甲、乙所示装置进行“探究加速度与力和质量的关系”实验，利用如图丙所示的装置进行“验证机械能守恒”实验.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/41e60dfa7ce2127f519d39ce562d2d6adf1e23bdec4b29405de7c57bdf180752.png","width":1369,"height":342,"width_mm":160.86,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n(1)下列说法正确的是（填空）.\nA. 图甲和图乙实验均需要平衡摩擦力\nB. 图甲和图乙实验均需要称量悬挂的重物质量\nC. 图甲和图乙实验均需要悬挂的重物质量远小于小车质量\nD. 图丙实验中应该用手托住重物由静止释放\n(2)已知打点计时器使用的是 50 Hz 的交流电源,进行图甲和图丙实验的实验小组不小心把他们的两条纸带弄混了,经过分析下图的计时点分布得知,以下纸带 （填空）(选填“A”或“B”)是图甲实验得到的纸带,其加速度大小为 （填空）m/s "},{"type":"math","value":"^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" . (保留两位有效数字)\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6134efa77b4f5c3263df635b3dbedd7b6358486acec8a60884adf63a28227eb2.png","width":1412,"height":198,"width_mm":165.9,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16-I图纸带A\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4a7e4bc93789ff779663878e357f4b91034506edae2899a2385dd532de2a824f.png","width":1435,"height":190,"width_mm":168.63,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16-I图 纸带B\n(3)进行图乙实验的实验小组,多次改变重物的质量,以弹簧测力计的拉力 F 为横轴,小车的加速度 a 为纵轴,画出一条斜率为 k 的倾斜直线,则小车的质量 M 为 （填空）(用 k 表示).\nⅡ. 小刚要测量某水库内水的电阻率, 用圆柱形容器装入水样品, 已知圆柱形容器内部长度为 l, 内部直径为 d.\n(1)小刚先用多用电表欧姆挡的“×100”倍率粗测待测样品的电阻,示数如图1所示,可知样品的电阻值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空） "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{k\\Omega}"},{"type":"text","value":" .\n(2)为更精确地测量样品的电阻,同时有尽可能大的测量范围,该小组打算用以下器材完成伏安法测样品电阻:\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3dcf64407409aa5aeb6450eca365c50646592e59cc0ef9c9c10d244bed7368e4.png","width":770,"height":343,"width_mm":90.487,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16-Ⅱ图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ccc1a37c23d5a650239f4cfb4054218f5f390b916cff597590cb86b61d069401.png","width":399,"height":335,"width_mm":46.919,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16-Ⅱ图2\nA. 电流表(量程 3 mA, 电阻约为 30 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":")\nB. 电压表(量程 6 V, 电阻约为 20 k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":")\nC. 滑动变阻器(0～20 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":", 额定电流 1 A)\nD. 电源(6 V, 内阻约为 1 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":")\nE. 开关一只、导线若干\n请用笔画线代替导线,把图 2 中测量纯净水样品电阻的电路补充完整.\n(3)如果测得电流表示数为 I，电压表示数为 U，都采用国际单位制单位，则它的电阻率 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）。（用 l、d、I、U 表示）\nⅢ. 在“用油膜法估测分子的大小”实验中，将体积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"V_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的纯油酸配成总体积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"V_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的油酸酒精溶液，用注射器取体积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"V_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的上述溶液，再把它一滴一滴地全部滴入烧杯，滴数为 N.\n(1) 把一滴油酸酒精溶液滴入浅盘中, 待稳定后得到油酸薄膜的轮廓形状和尺寸如图所示. 图中每个小正方形格的边长为 a, 可估算出油酸分子的直径为 （填空）.\nA. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_1V_0}{58NV_2a^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" B. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_1V_0}{68NV_2a^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" C. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{58V_1V_0N}{V_2a^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" D. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{68V_1V_0N}{V_2a^2}"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6fd0d2fb0b3ce778a66e470da57bb4c81e7e47eec259eeac35d98f33acb19896.png","width":358,"height":253,"width_mm":42,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q16-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16-III图\n(2)若配置好的油酸酒精溶液敞口后放置了较长时间再使用,实验得到的油酸分子直径数据 （填空）(选填“偏大”“偏小”或“无影响”)."}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ三题共14分)\n16-I(5分)\n(1) A(1 分)\n(2)B(1分) 1.7 到 1.8(1分)\n(3)2/k(2分)\n16-Ⅱ(5分)\n(1)2.2(1分) (2)如图(2分) (3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\pi Ud^{2}}{4Il}"},{"type":"text","value":"(2分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/762f1cf75e0b37a51ea06b9e858962dfa0096732673b19e3a842d747e61fd9e4.png","width":346,"height":297,"width_mm":43.8},{"type":"text","value":"16-Ⅲ(4分)\n(1)B(2分)\n(2) 偏小 (2 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"44642f8b5c20aa17dbf0d36ede5c4d897bc132f06bbdb57353bdeeef12134934","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(8分)如图所示,一带活塞的气缸放置在倾角可变的粗糙斜面上,其初始角度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,气缸质量 M=10 kg,活塞质量 m=8 kg,横截面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\ \\mathrm{cm}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,活塞与气缸间可无摩擦滑动,气缸与斜面间动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" ,大气压强 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1\\times10^{5}\\ \\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" 保持不变,初始环境温度 T=270 K,活塞此时离缸底 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}=18\\ \\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,气缸足够长且导热良好.\n(1)环境温度保持不变,倾角缓慢由 "},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 变为 "},{"type":"math","value":"30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 气缸内气体的内能 （填空）(选填“增大”“减小”或“不变”), 缸内气体 （填空）; (选填“吸热”“放热”或“不吸放热”)\n(2)角度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时, 气缸静止在斜面上, 求缸内气体压强;\n(3)角度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 保持不变, 环境温度由 270 K 逐渐上升到 330 K 的过程, 内能增加了 48 J, 求气体吸收的热量.\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8c883ce9b00bf8885ca8a3a1410cfd79d2a45ca22228c24422f6658a3364e03a.png","width":373,"height":274,"width_mm":43.68,"row_group":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的参数：重力加速度取 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\ \\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(8 分)\n(1) 不变 (1 分) 吸热 (1 分)\n(2)"},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\theta+p_{0}S=pS"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"p=1.48\\times10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n(3)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{1}}{T_{1}}=\\frac{V_{2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{2}=22\\ \\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"(或"},{"type":"math","value":"V_{2}=220\\ \\mathrm{cm}^{3}"},{"type":"text","value":") (1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"W = -p\\Delta V = -5.92\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = W + Q"},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 53.92\\ \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410","source_question_id":"gaosan-qiangji-lianmeng-2410-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"eeb73418ad69b973b7285cf0b0aa59b5cbc51644334f25772eb6ae21b8c79a11","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（11分）一游戏装置截面如图所示，该装置由固定平台 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 、竖直圆管道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":" 和倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 足够长的阻尼直轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"D^{'}E"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成。圆管道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":" 与平台相切于 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点，平台右端有一与平台等高固定的木板，平台 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 及木板足够长。平台中间位置有一小球 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 及滑块 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" ，中间有一弹性挡板隔开，小球与挡板碰撞后原速反弹。阻尼轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"D^{'}E"},{"type":"text","value":" 与管道相切，小球直径略小于管道直径，现给小球水平向左的初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 6\\sqrt{3}\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知圆轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BCD"},{"type":"text","value":" 半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.5\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小球 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1} = 0.05\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，滑块 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2} = 0.1\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小球受阻尼轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"D^{'}E"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻力恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.15\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小球与木板阻力不计，滑块与木板的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其余各接触面均光滑。\n(1)求小球 P 经过与圆心等高的 C 点时受到轨道对它的支持力大小；\n(2)若小球不滑出轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"D^{'}E"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求其长度的最小值 l，并求经过足够长时间，小球在直轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"D^{'}E"},{"type":"text","value":" 运动的总路程 s；\n(3)经过足够长时间,撤去挡板,小球 P 与滑块 Q 每次均为弹性碰撞,碰前 Q 均已静止,求 Q 第 3 次碰撞后到最终静止过程中在木板上滑行的总长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{Q}"},{"type":"text","value":" .\n"},{